  "shared.pages_terms.no_warranty_and_limitation_of_liability": "No warranty and limitation of liability",
  "shared.pages_terms.chlat_work_is_provided_without_warranties_of_any_kind": "ChlatWork is provided without warranties of any kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages or losses resulting from use of the tools.",
