  "shared.pages_cookies.how_chlat_work_uses_cookies_local_storage_analytics_advertising": "How ChlatWork uses cookies, local storage, analytics, advertising cookies, and similar technologies.",
  "shared.pages_cookies.this_page_explains_how_chlat_work_may_use_cookies": "This page explains how ChlatWork may use cookies and similar technologies for functionality, analytics, security, and advertising.",
  "shared.pages_cookies.what_cookies_are": "What cookies are",
  "shared.pages_cookies.cookies_are_small_files_stored_on_your_device_by": "Cookies are small files stored on your device by your browser. Similar technologies include local storage, pixels, web beacons, IP addresses, and other identifiers.",
