  "shared.pages_about.about_chlat_work_simple_online_tools": "About ChlatWork - Simple Online Tools",
  "shared.pages_about.learn_what_chlat_work_is_who_it_is_for": "Learn what ChlatWork is, who it is for, and how its simple privacy-friendly browser tools help with documents, images, QR codes, barcodes, dates, and productivity.",
  "shared.pages_about.about_chlat_work": "About ChlatWork",
  "shared.pages_about.chlat_work_is_an_independent_collection_of_focused_browser": "ChlatWork is an independent collection of focused browser tools for everyday work: PDFs, QR codes, image compression, text utilities, developer helpers, shared expenses, and small office tasks.",
  "shared.pages_about.the_goal_is_simple_each_page_should_help_you": "The goal is simple: each page should help you complete one real task without installing heavy software or guessing where to click next. A Google or Telegram login protects result access and account-owned data while still letting you open a tool first. The site gives extra attention to workflows common for Cambodian and Khmer users, such as Khmer text handling, Telegram sharing, restaurant menus, QR codes, and USD/KHR money tasks.",
  "shared.pages_about.last_updated_august_21_2026": "Last updated: August 21, 2026",
  "shared.pages_about.who_runs_chlat_work": "Who runs ChlatWork",
  "shared.pages_about.chlat_work_is_maintained_by_an_independent_builder_focused": "ChlatWork is maintained by {maintainerName}, an independent builder focused on practical web tooling for Cambodia and Khmer-English workflows.",
  "shared.pages_about.for_corrections_bug_reports_or_policy_questions_you_can": "For corrections, bug reports, or policy questions, you can use the ",
  "shared.pages_about.or_email": " or email ",
  "shared.pages_about.who_chlat_work_is_for": "Who ChlatWork is for",
  "shared.pages_about.chlat_work_is_for_students_office_teams_developers_freelancers": "ChlatWork is for students, office teams, developers, freelancers, shop owners, support staff, and anyone who needs a quick tool for a practical task. The site is built for repeat use: open a page, finish the work, and come back when the next small task appears.",
  "shared.pages_about.why_cambodia_and_khmer_workflows_matter": "Why Cambodia and Khmer workflows matter",
  "shared.pages_about.many_generic_tool_websites_work_technically_but_ignore_local": "Many generic tool websites work technically but ignore local details: Khmer text readability, mixed Khmer-English content, Telegram sharing, USD and KHR amounts, QR sharing links for restaurants, and small-business document workflows. ChlatWork is built to make those everyday tasks feel normal, not like edge cases.",
  "shared.pages_about.that_does_not_mean_every_tool_forces_a_cambodia": "That does not mean every tool forces a Cambodia example. A hash generator should stay technical, while tools such as QR codes, PayBack, Wi-Fi posters, Text to Voice, and Khmer Unicode cleanup should reflect how people actually work here.",
  "shared.pages_about.what_you_can_do_here": "What you can do here",
  "shared.pages_about.generate_barcodes_qr_codes_and_wi_fi_qr_posters": "Generate barcodes, QR codes, and Wi-Fi QR posters for labels, shops, inventory, events, and quick sharing.",
  "shared.pages_about.compress_images_and_convert_images_or_pdfs_for_forms": "Compress images and convert images or PDFs for forms, chat, printing, customer documents, and school or office submissions.",
  "shared.pages_about.use_developer_helpers_such_as_json_formatting_jwt_decoding": "Use developer helpers such as JSON formatting, JWT decoding, Base64, URL encoding, regex testing, timestamps, cron explanations, hashes, UUIDs, and password generation.",
  "shared.pages_about.split_shared_expenses_track_personal_spending_run_simple_lucky": "Split shared expenses, track personal spending, run simple lucky draws, clean Khmer Unicode text, and convert Khmer or English text to voice.",
  "shared.pages_about.how_the_tools_are_built": "How the tools are built",
  "shared.pages_about.chlat_work_tools_are_intentionally_small_and_task_specific": "ChlatWork tools are intentionally small and task-specific. A barcode page focuses on barcode output, a Wi-Fi QR page focuses on connection details and printable posters, and PDF pages focus on clear input, options, preview, and download steps.",
  "shared.pages_about.content_quality_and_updates_follow_a_documented": "Content quality and updates follow a documented ",
  "shared.pages_about.editorial_policy": "Editorial Policy",
  "shared.pages_about.with_extra_care_for_money_related_pages": " with extra care for money-related pages.",
  "shared.pages_about.privacy_first_approach": "Privacy-first approach",
  "shared.pages_about.many_chlat_work_tools_are_designed_to_run_directly": "Many ChlatWork tools are designed to run directly in your browser. ",
  "shared.pages_about.some_features_may_use_a_server_when_browser_only": "Some features may use a server when browser-only processing is not practical, such as API-backed audio generation or shared result links. In those cases, the site aims to process only what is needed for the feature and explains the behavior in the ",
  "shared.pages_about.why_chlat_work_exists": "Why ChlatWork exists",
  "shared.pages_about.chlat_means_smart_so_chlat_work_means_smart_work": "“Chlat” means smart—so ChlatWork means smart work. The goal is simple: provide tools that are easy to use, fast, reliable, and practical for the kinds of documents, links, labels, dates, and text that people deal with every day.",
  "shared.pages_about.the_site_is_updated_as_new_practical_needs_appear": "The site is updated as new practical needs appear. If a tool is unclear, broken, or missing a common workflow, you can send feedback through the ",
  "shared.pages_contact.contact_chlat_work": "Contact ChlatWork",
  "shared.pages_contact.contact_chlat_work_to_report_bugs_request_tools_share": "Contact ChlatWork to report bugs, request tools, share feedback, or ask privacy and cookie questions.",
  "shared.pages_contact.use_this_page_for_chlat_work_feedback_bug_reports": "Use this page for ChlatWork feedback, bug reports, privacy questions, and practical tool ideas. Clear reports help us find the right page, reproduce the issue, and improve the tool faster.",
