  "shared.markup_app_pages_privacy_policy_vue.while_you_are_signed_in_chlat_work_records_the": "While you are signed in, ChlatWork records the public identifier of each tool page you open, the event type, and the time. This account-linked history powers the Most used tools section in your profile and contributes to an aggregate Popular tools ranking. The public ranking does not identify individual accounts. Tool usage history does not include tool inputs, generated content, filenames, or URL query values.",
